                "original_url": "https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/feed\/update\/urn:li:activity:7306352643491196928\/",
                "fallback": "Yesterday, Ramy A. presented an awesome internal app his growth team built… | Thibaut Davoult",
                "text": "Yesterday, Ramy A. presented an awesome internal app his growth team built at Pigment. Today, it took me 2 hours to replicate and adapt it for our needs at Livestorm, without writing a single line of code :technologist:\n\nI let AI do all the hard work for me.\n\nThe tool itself is a simple web app that stores our 600 tier 1 ICP accounts data, and allows to fetch key information (when available) such as:\n\n- past and current webinar strategy\n- marketing strategy and big topics\n- overall company health, employee growth, revenue etc\n\nHere are the tools I used:\nBolt (for the frontend)\nSupabase (for the backend)\nNetlify (for deployment, so that the app is accessible to anyone with the link)\nOpenAI&amp;#39;s new web search end point\nLogo.dev for cool points\nand a simple csv export from our HubSpot\n\nThe result is an app that&amp;#39;s accessible to everyone at Livestorm, allowing to get an overview of key accounts in order to write well-targeted outreach, or prepare for upcoming calls.\nIt also allows to filter accounts based on employee range, country, industry.\n\nIt&amp;#39;s not perfect (the prompt definitely needs some refining), but I&amp;#39;m just amazed at how fast AI progressed when it comes to engineering help. \n\n&amp;quot;TAM Analysis Tool&amp;quot; is what Bolt decided to call it. It&amp;#39;s not the best branding. What else should we call it?\n\nh\/t Louis UGUEN Edouard U. for pushing the boundaries of Growth in France with your innovative approach, and again thanks to Francis Brero for the invite and inspiring discussion yesterday :raised_hands:",
                "title": "Yesterday, Ramy A. presented an awesome internal app his growth team built… | Thibaut Davoult",
                "title_link": "https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/feed\/update\/urn:li:activity:7306352643491196928\/",
                "service_name": "linkedin.com"
            }
        ],
